  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Oshadhi is a premium aromatherapy and botanical wellbeing brand offering a carefully curated range of pure essential oils, body oils, hydrosols, and natural wellness products. Our focus is on quality, purity, and plant integrity, with products chosen for both everyday ritual and professional use. We work with therapists, practitioners, and wellbeing advocates who value authenticity and want to share products they genuinely use and trust.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Oshadhi stands apart through the quality of our oils, the depth of our range, and our strong foundation in aromatherapy. We are not a trend-led wellness brand built around marketing language first — we are product-led, purity-led, and trusted by customers who care about what they are using. Our assortment supports both personal wellbeing and practitioner use, making Oshadhi especially relevant for therapists, bodyworkers, aromatherapists, and holistic professionals.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates receive a professional discount on their own purchases, along with commission on referred customer sales. This makes the program valuable both for practitioners who use Oshadhi in their own work and for those who recommend products to clients, audiences, or communities. There is also scope for higher discount tiers based on purchasing level or performance.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Oshadhi is well suited to authentic, education-led promotion. Affiliates tend to perform best by sharing how they use the products in practice, recommending favourites, creating simple rituals, highlighting seasonal wellbeing support, or introducing clients and followers to essential oils, body oils, and hydrosols they already love. This is a natural fit for therapists, aromatherapists, wellness practitioners, and trusted voices in holistic wellbeing.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We are looking for affiliates who align with the brand and can represent Oshadhi with credibility and care. This program is especially suited to practitioners and therapists who want a professional relationship with the brand rather than a traditional wholesale structure. We value long-term partners who genuinely use the products and share them in a way that feels informed, natural, and trustworthy.</p></div></div>",
